                <pb facs="0859" n="771" sameAs="frus:frus1904/pg771"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. McCormick to Mr.
                            Hay.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Embassy</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">St.
                                Petersburg</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1904-10-06"><hi rendition="#italic">October 6,
                        1904</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Greener telegraphs appraisement committee fixes bond for <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Calchas</hi> 674,830 rubles for release of steamer; neutral cargo still on
                    board.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">McCormick.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
